1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,200
The app you use the most wasn't built to make you happy.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:10,900
It was built to keep you here.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,400
Stay till the end: there's a challenge that could change your next 7 days.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:22,400
Every time you swipe, your brain places a bet: what if the next one is better?

5
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:28,400
Sometimes you get a like. Sometimes, nothing. And that's what hooks you.

6
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,600
The feed never ends. That's why you never feel satisfied.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,550
Bad news.

8
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,150
Overdue bill.

9
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,050
Her perfect life.

10
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,150
One more like. One more. One more…

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,200
You compare your backstage to their spotlight.

12
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,851
And you lose.

13
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,800
Surrounded by people… and no one is there.

14
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,400
And when you finally put the phone down…

15
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,207
the silence screams.
